{"id":"82f8e7c92cfb99ea","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-saturated-model-isomorphism.md","title":"Isomorphism of Saturated Models","display":"thm-saturated-model-isomorphism — Isomorphism of Saturated Models","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-saturated-model-isomorphism","aliases":["17-thm-saturated-model-isomorphism"],"display":"thm-saturated-model-isomorphism — Isomorphism of Saturated Models","depends_on":["[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]","[[17-df-elementary-equivalence]]","[[17-df-isomorphism]]","[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]"],"source_section":"5.1","source_result":"Theorem 5.1.13 (Uniqueness of Saturated Models)","source_pages_print":[298],"source_pages_djvu":[314],"source_verification":"statement compared in supplied OCR; local cardinal parameter spells out saturation","label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-thm-5.1.3","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-saturated-model-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-saturated-model-isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-saturated-model-isomorphism — Isomorphism of Saturated Models"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c973042c939008f\" href=\"?note=6c973042c939008f\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-saturation\">17-df-cardinal-saturation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bdfdb62527f9710d\" href=\"?note=bdfdb62527f9710d\" title=\"17-df-elementary-equivalence\">17-df-elementary-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f3187e8ff79e64e\" href=\"?note=9f3187e8ff79e64e\" title=\"17-df-isomorphism\">17-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"5.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Theorem 5.1.13 (Uniqueness of Saturated Models)"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>298</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>314</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement compared in supplied OCR; local cardinal parameter spells out saturation"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-5.1.3"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 为候选集合。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa\">\\(\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-saturation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6c973042c939008f\" href=\"?note=6c973042c939008f\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-saturation\">17-df-cardinal-saturation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_L\">\\(\\equiv_L\\)</span> (elementary equivalence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bdfdb62527f9710d\" href=\"?note=bdfdb62527f9710d\" title=\"17-df-elementary-equivalence\">17-df-elementary-equivalence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong\">\\(\\cong\\)</span> (structure isomorphism, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9f3187e8ff79e64e\" href=\"?note=9f3187e8ff79e64e\" title=\"17-df-isomorphism\">17-df-isomorphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span> (least infinite cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\n\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|\n=\n\\bigl||\\mathfrak B|\\bigr|\n=\n\\kappa\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak A)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak B)\n\\land\n\\mathfrak A\\equiv_L\\mathfrak B\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\n\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\n\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|\n=\n\\bigl||\\mathfrak B|\\bigr|\n=\n\\kappa\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak A)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak B)\n\\land\n\\mathfrak A\\equiv_L\\mathfrak B\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Saturation at the common infinite cardinal supports the transfinite back-and-forth construction of the isomorphism.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-cardinal-saturation","status":"resolved","id":"6c973042c939008f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"bdfdb62527f9710d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"9f3187e8ff79e64e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-saturation","status":"resolved","id":"6c973042c939008f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa$ ($\\kappa$-saturation predicate, see [[17-df-cardinal-saturation]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"bdfdb62527f9710d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\equiv_L$ (elementary equivalence, see [[17-df-elementary-equivalence]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"9f3187e8ff79e64e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\cong$ (structure isomorphism, see [[17-df-isomorphism]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-8","targ